    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82619" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιώσιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>immense, countless</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sol.
					24.7
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήδεα</span>
			<u>Lyr.Adesp.</u> in <u>TGF</u>p.xx ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῦλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					2.394
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.197
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Marin.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀργιοφάντης</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				688
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεάτρου κύκλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					1050
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Ephesus</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περισσός</span>
			, <i>unusual, rare</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιώσια
				εἰδώς</span>, of Pythagoras, <i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				129.1
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					4.354
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only neut. as Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιώσιον</span>, <i>beyond measure</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.359
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				16.203
			</span></i> : pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιώσια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Pan.</u>
					41
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιώσιον ἄλλων</span>
			<i>far beyond</i> the rest, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Cer.</u>
				362
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>I.</u>
				5(4).3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.466
			</span></i>.—Regul. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίως</span> only in <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> ; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περώσιος</span>.</div>
